  "fullDescription": "All-in-One Digital Planner designed to help you plan, track, organize, and reflect in one connected planner.\n\nWith 550 fully hyperlinked pages, this planner brings your daily planning, wellness, finances, personal growth, home management, notes, and stickers together in one place.\n\nWhat’s included:\n\nYearly Vision, Important Dates & Yearly Calendar\n12 Monthly Calendars & Monthly Overview pages\n60 Weekly Pages\n366 Daily Pages\nWellness section: Habit, Mood, Fitness & Sleep Trackers\nFinance section: Budget, Expenses, Bills & Subscriptions\nPersonal Growth: Vision, Skill Development & Life Insights\nHome section: Meal Planning, Cleaning, Home Maintenance, Travel & Holiday/Gift Planning\n16 Note layouts: Lined, Dotted, Grid & Blank\n300+ stickers: Icons, Labels, Dates & Numbers, Widgets & Shapes\n5 matching covers\nSide tabs for easy navigation\nFully hyperlinked navigation throughout the planner\n\nThe planner is undated, allowing you to start whenever you want and reuse it year after year.\n\nDigital product – No physical item will be shipped.",
